<title>EGYPT: Helwan Portland Cement to raise dividend.</title>
<headline>Helwan Portland Cement to raise dividend.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The board of Helwan Portland Cement will propose raising the dividend for the year 1995/6 to 4.75 pounds from 4.00 pounds in the previous year, company sources said on Monday. The years end June 30.</p>
<p>Helwan Cement shares traded on Monday in a range between 40.25 and 40.50 pounds a share.</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +20 2 578 3290/1</p>
</text>
